{
 "source": "fraud-review-bedrock policy.md v1 and tests/test_policy.py, tests/test_router.py (MIT, same author), vendored for EvalKit B5.13 RUL-01. Kinds mapped clear -> allow, no_clear -> never; reasons mapped unknown_clause -> unknown_rule, no_clear_clause_cited -> no_allow_rule_cited, no_clear -> never. Simulated card features, no personal data.",
 "rule_set": {
